      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Infra as code (Terraform / CDK) lives in Git, and a\nscheduled 'terraform plan' detects manual changes.\nIt detects, it doesn't self-heal like Argo CD.",
      "fontSize": 16,
